args: opentide --json generate docs --help
exit: 0

━━━ stdout
Generate markdown documentation for detection objects

Usage: opentide generate docs [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  rules       Generate rule documentation
  objectives  Generate objective documentation
  threats     Generate threat documentation
  index       Generate the documentation index pages

Options:
      --output <OUTPUT>
          Write the pages here instead of the configured docs folder

      --flavor <FLAVOR>
          Markdown flavour: github, gitlab, azure_devops or generic

      --rules
          Only rule pages; combine with --threats, --objectives

      --threats
          Only threat pages; combine with --rules, --objectives

      --objectives
          Only objective pages; combine with --rules, --threats

      --changed
          Regenerate only the pages of objects git reports as changed

      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide generate docs
  $ opentide generate docs --changed

━━━ stderr · empty
